        "blockId": "syntax-concept",
        "dimensions": [
          "syntax",
          "concept"
        ],
        "text": "preliminary修饰findings；not a final conclusion是明确对照，不能在中文摘要中省略。 初步发现可以指示后续调查方向，但证据和解释可能继续变化。原句没有说发现是错误的，只限定其阶段和结论强度。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "oewn-2025",
            "sourceVersion": "2025",
            "locator": "entries-p.json/preliminary/a / preliminary%5:00:00:exploratory:00",
            "supportedClaim": "denoting an action or event preceding or in preparation for something more important",
            "url": "https://en-word.net/"
          }
        ],
        "title": "句子结构与当前所指"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "contrast",
        "dimensions": [
          "contrast"
        ],
        "text": "preliminary强调初步阶段；initial只是最初；tentative强调尚不确定。最早的一次正式测量可以是initial，但不一定是tentative。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "容易混淆的地方"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "game-neighbors",
        "dimensions": [
          "languageGame",
          "englishNeighbors"
        ],
        "text": "这是结果汇报的证据分级。可接着问样本范围、未完成检查和下一步确认方式，避免将初步材料过早转为定论。 preliminary findings/report连到further review、additional data；final conclusion是需要后续证据支持的不同状态。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "讨论通常怎样继续"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "action",
        "dimensions": [
          "pragmaticAction"
        ],
        "text": "说话者在限制听者对结果的使用强度，预防过早下结论。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "说话者正在做什么"
      },
